sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant BookForSaleController
    participant PurchaseModel
    participant Database

    User->>Frontend: Request to Buy Book
    Frontend->>BookForSaleController: POST /purchases {book_for_sale_id}
    BookForSaleController->>Database: Verify user role & sufficient balance
    Database-->>BookForSaleController: Status OK
    BookForSaleController->>Database: Deduct price from user balance
    Database-->>BookForSaleController: Balance Updated
    BookForSaleController->>Database: Create Purchase Record
    Database-->>BookForSaleController: Record Created
    BookForSaleController->>PurchaseModel: Check BookForSale stock
    PurchaseModel->>Database: Decrement stock by 1
    Database-->>PurchaseModel: Stock Updated
    BookForSaleController-->>Frontend: Success Response (200 OK)
    Frontend-->>User: Display Purchase Complete
